            { heading: 'Common mistakes beginners should avoid', bullets: ['Athletic trainer role ko personal trainer ya physio role ke saath confuse karna', 'Pain ko ignore karke athlete ko continue karwana', 'Diagnosis/treatment claims karna without qualification and scope', 'Warm-up ko random stretching routine samajhna instead of progressive preparation', 'Recovery tracking, incident notes, and referral records maintain na karna', 'Same warm-up/mobility routine har sport and athlete par copy-paste karna'] }
