            { heading: 'Common mistakes beginners should avoid', bullets: ['Sirf rote theory padhkar field application/context ignore karna', 'Mineralogy identification tables and stratigraphy timelines irregular revise karna', 'Maps and cross-section practice postpone karna', 'Mock tests dena but topic-wise analysis skip karna', 'Current affairs ko earth-resource, mining, groundwater, environment lens se na dekhna', 'Official notification verify kiye bina eligibility assumptions banana', 'Document verification prep last-minute rakhna'] }
