          overview:
            'Yeh guide Assistant Wildlife Warden ya Assistant Soil Conservation Officer roadmap ka duplicate nahi hai. Un roles ka focus government exam/service pathway par hota hai, jabki Environmental Scientist ka unique angle hai scientific sampling, pollution and ecology analysis, environmental impact interpretation, and technical reporting for projects and compliance decisions.',
